/**
 * Writes a numeric value represented as a {@link java.lang.String} into the token buffer.
 * This method attempts to preserve the numeric identity and precision by parsing the
 * input string into the most appropriate numeric type ({@code int}, {@code long},
 * {@code BigInteger}, {@code double}, or {@code BigDecimal}).
