 * If the {@code _forceBigDecimal} flag is enabled, the string will always be parsed
 * as a {@code BigDecimal}. Otherwise, it prioritizes integer types for strings
 * without decimal points or exponents, falling back to {@code double} and then
 * {@code BigDecimal} for floating-point representations.
