/**
 * Calculates the Weighted Root Mean Square (WRMS) of the residuals.
 * The WRMS is computed as the square root of the sum of squared residuals,
 * each multiplied by its corresponding weight, divided by the sum of all weights.
 * This provides a measure of the overall magnitude of the weighted residuals,
 * giving more importance to residuals with higher weights.
